{"id":"n72464-1-12","stage":1,"title":"할인 · 打折","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72464-1-12-1","ko":"이렇게 비싼 데서 네가 밥을 사겠다고?","zh":"这么贵的地方，你居然要请客？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비싼","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데서","meaning":"处所，地方。","explanation":"데：处所，地方。；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사겠다고?","meaning":"请客，付账，买单","explanation":"사다：请客，付账，买单；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"5","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"处所，地方。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"处所，地方。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"请客，付账，买单","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"支付与他人一起吃饭的费用。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ad878d116564cf25f31.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72464-1-12-2","ko":"응. 할인 쿠폰이 있거든.","zh":"嗯。我有折扣优惠券啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할인","meaning":"打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价","explanation":"할인：打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价","readings":[{"term":"할인","audio":"/audio/37ccd7d822c8e4eb7b32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72464","senseId":"1","lemma":"할인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쿠폰이","meaning":"礼券","explanation":"쿠폰：礼券；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"쿠폰","audio":"/audio/14845c43b2f5fd9c89f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81164","senseId":"2","lemma":"쿠폰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있거든.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"37ccd7d822c8e4eb","term":"할인","zh":"打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价","audio":"/audio/37ccd7d822c8e4eb7b32.mp3","entryId":"72464","definition":"从原定价格上减去一些。","pronunciation":["하린"]},{"id":"14845c43b2f5fd9c","term":"쿠폰","zh":"礼券","audio":"/audio/14845c43b2f5fd9c89f5.mp3","entryId":"81164","definition":"贴在商品上的优惠券或可兑换赠品的小票。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c382683bbf7d17dfd6a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72464","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":59,"sequenceScore":3.0076,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这么贵的地方，你居然要请客？","嗯。我有折扣优惠券啊。","现在有很多孩子比起韩国料理，更喜欢西餐。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这么贵的地方，你居然要请客？","嗯。我有折扣优惠券啊。","现在有很多孩子比起韩国料理，更喜欢西餐。"],"answer":1}]}
